  "content": "<h1>庫存擴展 - yyz的背包模組</h1><p><strong>直接整合背包</strong><br>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7c7ebd872683a4f5860d80ac023b9a0674a9c4f9.gif\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"385\" height=\"223\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1d862f817680bcf1cbec51827a8020691d9c7c97.gif\" alt=\"合成\" width=\"390\" height=\"226\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2d03ad242b88889756076fae21bd2e2871698735.gif\" alt=\"儲存\" width=\"390\" height=\"226\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/011b793aa53f969f2ec6d5257f7603bc56789ca1.gif\" alt=\"拾取\" width=\"390\" height=\"226\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/05c7b41411b7a40589213223687065285ee8da74.png\" alt=\"模型\" width=\"784\" height=\"458\"> &nbsp;</p><h2>🌟 模組亮點</h2><h3>⚡ 無縫GUI整合</h3><p>背包欄位將直接顯示在<strong>工作GUI</strong>（物品欄/合成台/儲物箱等）中，無需開啟額外介面。</p><h3>🛠️ 增強功能</h3><ul>\n<li>🖱️&nbsp;<strong>物品轉移</strong><br>Shift+左鍵 → 轉移至主物品欄 &nbsp;<br>Shift+右鍵 → 轉移至背包 &nbsp;物品欄<br>雙擊 → 自動排序物品 &nbsp;</li>\n<li>📦&nbsp;<strong>物品收集</strong><br>物品欄滿時自動將物品存入背包<br>死亡時背包會以單一物品形式掉落（內容物保留）</li>\n<li>🔥<strong>JEI/REI/EMI 整合</strong><br>支援<strong>直接從JEI/REI/EMI合成配方中</strong>使用背包物品<br>配方介面即時顯示背包內容物</li>\n<li>💍&nbsp;<strong>飾品支援</strong><br>背包可放入<strong>Curios/Trinkets 飾品欄位</strong></li>\n</ul><h2>🎒 背包等級</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>背包類型</th>\n<th>額外欄位</th>\n<th>特殊能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>木製</td>\n<td>+9</td>\n<td>基礎容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>石製</td>\n<td>+18</td>\n<td>基礎容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鐵製</td>\n<td>+27</td>\n<td>基礎容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金製</td>\n<td>+36</td>\n<td>基礎容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鑽石</td>\n<td>+45</td>\n<td>基礎容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>獄髓</strong></td>\n<td><strong>+54</strong></td>\n<td><strong>火焰免疫</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>⚙️ 相容性</h2><p>若不易查看，請於此處檢視：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyyzs-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/yyzs-backpack</a></p><h3>狀態標示</h3><ul>\n<li>✅&nbsp;<strong>完全相容</strong></li>\n<li>⚠️&nbsp;<strong>部分支援</strong></li>\n<li>⌛&nbsp;<strong>計劃中</strong></li>\n<li>❌&nbsp;<strong>不支援</strong></li>\n</ul><h3>功能支援狀態</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>&nbsp;</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>1.21.6</th>\n<th>1.21.5</th>\n<th>1.21.4</th>\n<th>1.21.2-1.21.3</th>\n<th>1.21.1</th>\n<th>1.20.5-1.20.6</th>\n<th>1.20.2-1.20.4</th>\n<th>1.20.1</th>\n<th>1.19.4</th>\n<th>1.19.3</th>\n<th>1.19-1.19.2</th>\n<th>1.18-1.18.2</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>JEI</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Curios</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trinkets</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Quark</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Accessories</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>REI</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EMI</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Inventorio</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IPN</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>⚠️</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物品欄排序</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3D模型</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Doggy Talents Next</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AE2</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>⌛</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>❓ 為什麼選擇此背包？</h2><p>傳統背包模組 = 需要獨立GUI的行動儲物箱。我們的解決方案：</p><ol>\n<li><strong>無縫體驗</strong> - 直接在<strong>工作GUI</strong>中存取背包物品</li>\n<li><strong>原生互動</strong> - 完整支援配方書/<strong>JEI/REI/EMI</strong></li>\n<li><strong>背包更換</strong> - 將背包放入背包欄位/內部時可進行更換</li>\n<li><strong>持續擴展</strong> - 不斷增加模組相容性支援</li>\n</ol><p>未定義</p><h2>⚠️ 目前狀態</h2><p><strong>該模組目前處於非常早期的階段。如果您發現任何錯誤，可透過GitHub或Discord回報</strong><br>❗ 發現問題或有建議？&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/yyz729/yyzsbackpack/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f3NPKBgXxVU\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></li>\n</ul><p>🔧 <strong>開發中</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>更多GUI支援</li>\n<li>背包3D模型</li>\n<li>擴展模組相容性</li>\n</ul><blockquote>\n<p>✨&nbsp;<strong>設計理念</strong>：讓背包成為主物品欄的自然延伸</p>\n</blockquote>",
